    "faq_tab_accordion_1_G3DWhA": {
      "type": "faq_tab_accordion_1",
      "blocks": {
        "text_JaTjtj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "What is a fruit flavoured nicotine pouch?",
            "ans": "<p>A fruit flavoured nicotine pouch is a discreet, smoke-free way to enjoy nicotine with a juicy twist. Instead of tobacco, each pouch contains nicotine, plant-based materials, and bold fruity flavour, think sweet <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/berry\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Berry</span></a> or refreshing <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/watermelon\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Watermelon</span></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_4aVx9q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "What fruit flavours do you have?",
            "ans": "<p>Our fruit flavoured nicotine pouch collection is all about bold, juicy flavour. From lush <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/berry\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Berry </span></a>and subtly sweet <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/watermelon\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Watermelon</span></a>, to exciting <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/zest-ice\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Zest Ice</span></a>, fiery <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/spicy-cherry\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Spicy Cherry</span></a> and sweet <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/peach-passion\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Peach Passion</span></a>. Each one brings a fruit-forward experience that tastes as good as it sounds.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_xVfGQj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "What makes your fruit flavoured nicotine pouches special?",
            "ans": "<p>Our fruit flavoured nicotine pouches are crafted to bring you proper, authentic fruit flavour, with no weird artificial aftertaste, just juicy satisfaction. They’re 100% tobacco-free and made to pharmaceutical-grade standards, so you know you’re getting quality with every pouch. It’s all the flavour you want, with none of the extras you don’t.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_ePGqpN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "Are fruit flavoured nicotine pouches suitable for beginners?",
            "ans": "<p>Absolutely! Fruit flavoured nicotine pouches are a great starting point thanks to their smooth, familiar taste. If you’re new, we recommend starting with our Mild (4mg) or Regular (6mg) strength for a balanced introduction.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_fDta4K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "What nicotine strengths are available in fruit flavoured nicotine pouches?",
            "ans": "<p>We’ve got a strength for everyone, whether you’re just getting started or prefer something stronger. Most of our fruit flavours come in Regular (6mg), ideal for a balanced experience. Want something lighter? Go for Mild (4mg) in our easy-going <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/peach-passion\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Peach Passion</span></a>. After more intensity? <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/watermelon\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Watermelon</span></a> and <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/zest-ice\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Zest Ice</span></a> bring the heat with Strong (11mg) and Max (14mg) options.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_X7EmAE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "How long do fruit flavoured nicotine pouches last?",
            "ans": "<p>Each pouch keeps the flavour going strong for up to 30 minutes. The fruity taste remains vibrant throughout the experience, whether you're into <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/berry\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Berry</span></a>, <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/watermelon\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Watermelon</span></a> or <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/spicy-cherry\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Spicy Cherry</span></a>, you’ll get a steady, satisfying release that doesn’t fade halfway through.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_DNyqfe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "Which fruit flavoured nicotine pouches are most popular?",
            "ans": "<p><a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/products/watermelon\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Watermelon</span></a> is consistently one of our most popular fruit flavoured nicotine pouches, loved for its refreshing and subtly sweet profile that's perfect for any occasion.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_BhmyjU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "How do fruit flavoured nicotine pouches compare to other flavours?",
            "ans": "<p>Fruit flavoured nicotine pouches offer a sweeter, more indulgent experience compared to <a href=\"https://ubbspouches.com/collections/mint-flavours\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">mint varieties</span></a>. They’re less sharp, more laid-back, and perfect if you’re after a smooth ride with bold taste. No tobacco, no harsh burn—just good vibes and great flavour.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_b4whFM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "ques": "Are fruit flavoured nicotine pouches tobacco-free?",
            "ans": "<p>Yes! All our fruit flavoured nicotine pouches are 100% tobacco-free, smoke-free, and vape-free. All our fruit pouches are made to pharmaceutical-grade standards and contain nicotine, plant-based materials, flavourings, sweeteners and water. Nothing else.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
